    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d647">

                <pb facs="0748" n="732" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg732"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/10–347</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">McBride</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                        <lb/> No. 715</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-03">October 3,
                        1947</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to Embassy’s telegram
                    number 368 of September 30 and previous correspondence<anchor n="28"
                        xml:id="d647-f1"/> regarding the termination of the Financial Agreement
                    between the Governments of the United States and Haiti, signed on September 13,
                        1941,<anchor n="29" xml:id="d647-f2"/> I have the honor to transmit herewith
                    a copy of the Note which was left with the Minister of Foreign Affairs on
                    October 1, formally stating that the Government <pb facs="0749" n="733"
                        xml:id="pg733"/> of the United States considered the agreement automatically
                    to have ceased to have effect.<anchor n="30" xml:id="d647-f3"/>
                </p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert</hi> H. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >McBride</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d647-f1" n="28" xml:id="d647-f1-content">
                <p>None printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d647-f2" n="29" xml:id="d647-f2-content">
                <p>Department of State Executive Agreement Series No. 220, or 55 Stat. (pt. 2) 1348;
                    for documentation on this subject, see <ref target="frus1941v07#pg_322">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1941, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">vii</hi>, pp. 322</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d647-f3" n="30" xml:id="d647-f3-content">
                <p>For Understanding Between the United States and Haiti Respecting Haitian
                    Finances, effected by exchange of notes signed at Port-au-Prince October 1,
                    1947, see TIAS No. 1862, or 61 Stat. (pt. 4) 4111.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
